/* lattice.yon — the package file of `lattice`, under prelude/.
 *
 * The site of the Leech lattice's type-2 shell: its points, the frames that
 * relate them, the Co0 words that carry one onto another. A point is an
 * abstract type over its coordinate: made only where it is one, read only
 * through what it offers. The lattice collections (prelude/coll) are keyed
 * by these points. */
